    content: # ============================================================
# translator-team — Root recipe for the Translator MAS
# Architecture: PARALLEL dispatch + VOTING
# ============================================================
name: translator-team
description: >
  Multi-Agent System for translation using PARALLEL + VOTING
  architecture. Three translator agents (literal, literary,
  technical) independently translate the same text in parallel.
  A judge agent scores and VOTES for the best translation.
version: 1.0.0
sub_recipes:
  - sub/translator-orchestrator
  - sub/translator-literal
  - sub/translator-literary
  - sub/translator-technical
  - sub/translation-judge

instructions: |
  # translator-team — PARALLEL + VOTING Translation MAS

  This Multi-Agent System translates text from one language to another
  using a parallel generation + voting architecture.

  ## Architecture

  ┌─────────────────────────┐
  │ translator-orchestrator │  (receives input, coordinates)
  └────┬──────┬──────┬──────┘
       │      │      │
       ▼      ▼      ▼         PARALLEL dispatch (ALL 3 at once)
  ┌────────┐┌────────┐┌────────┐
  │literal ││literary││technic.│
  └────────┘└────────┘└────────┘
       │      │      │
       └──────┼──────┘
              ▼
       ┌──────────────┐
       │  judge       │  (scores, votes, selects winner)
       └──────┬───────┘
              ▼
        Winning translation

  ## Usage
  This recipe expects input as a JSON object with:
  - source_text:  The text to translate
  - source_lang:  The source language (e.g., "en", "de", "fr")
  - target_lang:  The target language (e.g., "de", "en", "es")

  The orchestrator will:
  1. PARALLEL dispatches the source text to all 3 translator agents
  2. Collects all 3 independent translations
  3. Delegates to the judge agent who scores and VOTES
  4. Returns the winning translation with reasoning

  ## Example
  Input: {"source_text": "Hello world", "source_lang": "en", "target_lang": "de"}
  Output: {"winner": "...", "scores": {...}, "reasoning": "...", "final_text": "..."}

